1
00:00:04,512 --> 00:00:07,222
(Howard:)Check it out. Press release. From NASA.

2
00:00:07,390 --> 00:00:11,730
Ahem. "Expedition 31 will launch this spring
to the International Space Station.

3
00:00:11,936 --> 00:00:15,066
(Raj:)Crew members will include
Commander Tom'Tombo' Johnson...

4
00:00:15,231 --> 00:00:20,321
...astronaut Mike'Supernova' Novacelik,
and payload specialist Howard Wolowitz."

5
00:00:21,904 --> 00:00:25,364
(Howard:)This is going right into
my synagogue's newsletter.

6
00:00:26,784 --> 00:00:30,124
(Raj:)If you're going to be an astronaut,
you need to pick a cool nickname.

7
00:00:30,288 --> 00:00:32,828
(Howard:)I don't get to.
The other guys have to give it to me.

8
00:00:32,999 --> 00:00:36,629
(Raj:)Oh. If I had one,
it would be Brown Dynamite.

9
00:00:38,504 --> 00:00:42,594
(Howard:)Are you not listening to me? The other
astronauts have to give you your nickname.

10
00:00:42,758 --> 00:00:45,548
(Raj:)Are you not looking at me?
I am Brown Dynamite.

11
00:00:49,307 --> 00:00:51,307
(Raj:)Why do you put six sugars
in your coffee?

12
00:00:51,475 --> 00:00:55,645
(Leonard:)Because the cafeteria doesn't offer
Iittle packets of methamphetamine.

13
00:00:56,355 --> 00:00:58,775
- Emergency drill night last night, huh?
- Uh-huh.

14
00:00:58,941 --> 00:01:02,111
- How'd you do?
- I'll tell you exactly how he did.

